0..75 Comment "// The nominal binding port (Pitts, _Nominal Sets_, CUP 2013, ch. 4; Gabbay"
76..155 Comment "// and Mathijssen, _Nominal (universal) algebra_, JLC 2009). `bind (a : N) . T`"
156..231 Comment "// abstracts an atom of the atom sort `N` over a port of sort `T`: swapping"
232..311 Comment "// renames the atom and it may escape, where `pi+ (x : S) . T` binds a variable"
312..391 Comment "// that substitution instantiates. Each block is a value of `Theory` that keeps"
392..469 Comment "// an abstracting port as an `Abstracted` link of its operation\'s port chain,"
470..510 Comment "// so a program reads it back by `case`."
512..590 Comment "/// The π-calculus\'s processes: `nu` restricts a channel name over a process,"
591..610 Comment "/// abstracting it."
